    "rationale": "Update the election-result rendering logic for eliminated candidates so the second-round column shows an em dash (—) in the cell rather than the literal status text “Eliminated.” If the UI is driven by API data, normalize the display layer to map eliminated/withdrawn candidates to blank/emdash cells in round columns while still preserving their status elsewhere. Then redeploy the frontend/backend service so the Bond row matches the expected table format."
